{"id":"n51220-1-6","stage":4,"title":"덧나다 · (伤病)恶化","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51220-1-6-1","ko":"어쩌다 이렇게 덧났어?","zh":"伤口怎么恶化成这样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"意外地","explanation":"어쩌다：意外地","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14591","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덧났어?","meaning":"(伤病)恶化，加重","explanation":"덧나다：(伤病)恶化，加重；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"덧나다","audio":"/audio/904e4acc55cd5c470e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51220","senseId":"1","lemma":"덧나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"意外地","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"14591","definition":"不料偶然地。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"904e4acc55cd5c47","term":"덧나다","zh":"(伤病)恶化，加重","audio":"/audio/904e4acc55cd5c470e45.mp3","entryId":"51220","definition":"由于病症或伤口等没有得到妥善处理，状态变得更严重。","pronunciation":["던나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9d904841c098280eba85.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n51220-1-6-2","ko":"운동을 좀 심하게 했더니 상처에 땀이 배서…….","zh":"运动太剧烈，汗水浸到伤口里了……","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심하게","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했더니","meaning":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","explanation":"하다：表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상처에","meaning":"伤口，伤","explanation":"상처：伤口，伤；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"상처","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62979","senseId":"1","lemma":"상처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"땀이","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배서…….","meaning":"浸，浸透","explanation":"배다：浸，浸透；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"배다","audio":"/audio/fe8bb9bce639b1ec904b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15904","senseId":"1","lemma":"배다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","audio":"/au